  "story": [
    "NZMS260 was New Zealand’s 1:50,000 metric topographic map series, published from 1977 to 1997. Its first sheet was T12 Thames. The series used the New Zealand Map Grid with NZGD49 and replaced the earlier imperial NZMS1 sheets."
